      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and i felt this crazy ripping sensation in my mid-back. it's kinda spreading down to my stomach now too. i'm pretty sure i just pulled a muscle or something bad, but it hurts a lot. should i just take a bunch of ibuprofen and lie down? what's a good dose to maybe knock this out?",
